{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高辛氏有二子，長曰閼伯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是真如"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名藏識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名轉識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王莽篡位曰新室，子雲上書曰美新"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所傳部別，所依正教，依正消釋，大意總別，心境相疑，解行相資，吁疑顯正等例"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "審字不審音如諸呪，審音不審字如卍是，音字俱審如諸經，音字俱不審\n如梵夾等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "會正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記引論語、\n曲禮以況吾道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記云：儒宗君子\n尚違庖厨，故舉以為況。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記引易云：困于盤石蒺䔧。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記引孟子：所惡於智者，其為穿鑿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記引曾子：喻父母於道等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
